  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Light; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 9,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nA sanguine tattoo generally depicts scenes of battle and conquest, or of blood and bones; often its light is a shade of red, or sometimes ivory or gray. It grants you a +4 competence bonus to Intimidate checks so long as the tattoo is shedding any amount of light. In addition, you may attempt to demoralize an enemy within the primary radius of your light as a move action.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Light sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 4,500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
